OL,3,GNEWSAChallenge to UK's largest solar
OL,4,Afarm plan rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FA legal challenge to the UK's largest
OL,7,Fcurrently approved solar farm has been
OL,8,Frejected by the High Court.
OL,10,FThe Department for Energy Security and
OL,11,FNet Zero (DESNZ) approved Springwell
OL,12,FSolar Farm, between Lincoln and
OL,13,FSleaford, in April, saying it would
OL,14,Fhelp "bring down bills for good".
OL,16,FLincolnshire County Council and North
OL,17,FKesteven District Council sought to
OL,18,Foverturn the decision, arguing the
OL,19,Fproject would harm rural communities
OL,20,Fand landscapes.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
