OL,3,GNEWSAChallenge to UK's largest solar
OL,4,Afarm plan rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FCounty Council leader Sean Matthews
OL,7,Fsaid he was disappointed with the
OL,8,Fdecision, while developer EDF said it
OL,9,Fwas pleased, adding it would "make
OL,10,Fimportant contributions to the UK's
OL,11,Fsecurity of electricity supply".
